            <div class="product-info"><span class="pill">Dinner</span><h3>Mandarin Orange Chicken</h3><p>Crispy chicken bites in a sweet & tangy mandarin sauce</p><strong>$4.99</strong></div>
          </article>
          <article class="product-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486297678162-eb2a19b0a32d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Assorted cheese wedges" />
            <div class="product-info"><span class="pill">Cheese</span><h3>Unexpected Cheddar Cheese</h3><p>Aged cheddar with crystalline crunch and complex flavor</p><strong>$3.99</strong></div>
          </article>
          <article class="product-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544145945-f90425340c7e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Fresh fruit lemonade drinks" />
            <div class="product-info"><span class="pill">Beverage</span><h3>Spicy Mango Lemonade</h3><p>Tropical mango with a kick of chili and fresh lemon</p><strong>$2.79</strong></div>
          </article>
          <article class="product-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508061253366-f7da158b6d46?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Roasted almonds in a bowl" />
            <div class="product-info"><span class="pill">Snack</span><h3>Truffle Marcona Almonds</h3><p>Roasted marcona almonds dusted with black truffle salt</p><strong>$4.49</strong></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="seasonal section-pad" id="seasonal">
      <div class="section-heading centered">
        <p class="eyebrow"><i class="ri-sun-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i> Limited-time flavors</p>
        <h2>Summer Favorites Are Here 🌞</h2>
        <p>Limited-time flavors crafted for the season — grab them before they're gone!</p>
      </div>
      <div class="seasonal-grid">
        <article class="seasonal-card highlight">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523362628745-0c100150b504?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="Sparkling summer drink with mint" />
          <div><h3>Watermelon Mint Sparkling Water</h3><p>Refreshing fizz with real watermelon essence and a hint of mint.</p><strong>$1.99</strong></div>
        </article>
        <article class="seasonal-card">
          <i class="ri-bowl-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Grilled Peach & Burrata Salad Kit</h3><p>Everything you need for a summer salad in one box.</p><strong>$5.49</strong>
        </article>
        <article class="seasonal-card">
          <i class="ri-cup-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Coconut Cold Brew Concentrate</h3><p>Smooth, creamy cold brew with natural coconut flavor.</p><strong>$6.99</strong>
        </article>
        <article class="seasonal-card">
          <i class="ri-restaurant-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Mango Sticky Rice Spring Rolls</h3><p>A sweet twist on a classic, ready in minutes.</p><strong>$3.99</strong>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="categories section-pad" aria-labelledby="categories-title">
      <div class="section-heading centered">
        <p class="eyebrow"><i class="ri-layout-grid-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i> Wander the aisles</p>
        <h2 id="categories-title">Shop by Category</h2>
        <p>Hover each card for a little market magic.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="category-grid">
        <a class="category-card" href="#products" style="--bg:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606312619070-d48b4c652a52?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80')"><span>Chips, cookies, trail mixes, and guilty pleasures</span><strong>Snacks & Sweets</strong></a>
        <a class="category-card" href="#products" style="--bg:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540420773420-3366772f4999?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80')"><span>Seasonal fruits, vegetables, and organic picks</span><strong>Fresh Produce</strong></a>
        <a class="category-card" href="#products" style="--bg:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504674900247-0877df9cc836?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80')"><span>Meals, appetizers, and desserts straight from the freezer</span><strong>Frozen Favorites</strong></a>
        <a class="category-card" href="#products" style="--bg:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497534446932-c925b458314e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80')"><span>Juices, sparkling waters, coffees, and teas</span><strong>Beverages</strong></a>
        <a class="category-card" href="#products" style="--bg:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1452195100486-9cc805987862?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80')"><span>Artisan cheeses, yogurts, milk, and plant-based alternatives</span><strong>Dairy & Cheese</strong></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="locator section-pad" id="stores">
      <div class="locator-card">
        <div class="locator-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow"><i class="ri-map-pin-2-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i> Store locator</p>
          <h2>Find Your Fresh Pantry</h2>
          <p>Enter your zip code to discover the nearest store, hours, and directions.</p>
        </div>
        <form class="locator-form" id="locator-form">
          <label class="sr-only" for="zip-code">Enter your zip code</label>
          <input id="zip-code" name="zip" type="text" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Enter your zip code" autocomplete="postal-code" />
          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Search</button>
        </form>
        <div class="store-results" id="store-results" aria-live="polite" hidden>
          <article class="store-card"><div><h3>Fresh Pantry — Lincoln Park</h3><p>2140 N. Halsted St, Chicago, IL 60614</p></div><span>8am – 9pm Daily</span><strong>0.8 mi</strong></article>
          <article class="store-card"><div><h3>Fresh Pantry — Wicker Park</h3><p>1840 W. North Ave, Chicago, IL 60622</p></div><span>8am – 9pm Daily</span><strong>1.4 mi</strong></article>
          <article class="store-card"><div><h3>Fresh Pantry — Lakeview</h3><p>3745 N. Lincoln Ave, Chicago, IL 60613</p></div><span>8am – 9pm Daily</span><strong>2.1 mi</strong></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="newsletter section-pad" aria-labelledby="newsletter-title">
      <div class="newsletter-card">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow"><i class="ri-mail-heart-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i> Fresh notes</p>
          <h2 id="newsletter-title">Stay Fresh 🍋</h2>
          <p>Sign up for weekly deals, new product alerts, and seasonal recipes delivered to your inbox.</p>
        </div>
        <form class="newsletter-form" id="newsletter-form">
          <label class="sr-only" for="email">Your email address</label>
          <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="Your email address" required />
          <button class="btn btn-secondary" type="submit">Subscribe</button>
        </form>
        <p class="form-message" id="newsletter-message" role="status" hidden>Thanks for subscribing! Check your inbox for a welcome treat.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <a class="brand" href="#top"><span class="brand-mark"><i class="ri-leaf-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span>Fresh Pantry</span></a>
      <p>© 2024 Fresh Pantry. Discover Everyday Deliciousness.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <div><h3>Shop</h3><a href="#products">Products</a><a href="#seasonal">Seasonal Picks</a><a href="#products">New Arrivals</a><a href="#products">Gift Cards</a></div>
      <div><h3>Company</h3><a href="#about">About Us</a><a href="#about">Careers</a><a href="#about">Press</a><a href="#about">Sustainability</a></div>
      <div><h3>Help</h3><a href="#stores">Store Locator</a><a href="#stores">FAQs</a><a href="#stores">Contact Us</a><a href="#stores">Accessibility</a></div>
      <div><h3>Follow Us</h3><a href="#top">Instagram</a><a href="#top">Facebook</a><a href="#top">Pinterest</a><a href="#top">TikTok</a></div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
EOF

cat > /app/output/styles.css <<'EOF'
:root {
  --forest: #2d6a4f;
  --forest-dark: #1f4c39;
  --mint: #d8f3dc;
  --sage: #b7d7bd;
  --cream: #fefae0;
  --cream-2: #fffdf2;
  --orange: #f4a261;
  --terracotta: #d96c4f;
  --yellow: #ffd166;
  --ink: #21352b;
  --muted: #637568;
  --white: #ffffff;
  --shadow: 0 20px 55px rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.14);
  --soft-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.10);
  --radius-lg: 34px;
  --radius-md: 22px;
  --radius-sm: 14px;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  color: var(--ink);
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 8% 4%, rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.35), transparent 28rem),
    radial-gradient(circle at 90% 18%, rgba(216, 243, 220, 0.85), transparent 32rem),
    var(--cream-2);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
button, input { font: inherit; }

.sr-only {
  position: absolute;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  padding: 0;
  margin: -1px;
  overflow: hidden;
  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
  white-space: nowrap;
  border: 0;
}

.site-header {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 20;
  padding: 16px clamp(18px, 4vw, 56px);
  background: rgba(255, 253, 242, 0.82);
  backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.10);
}

.navbar {
  max-width: 1180px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 24px;
}

.brand {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-family: "Nunito", sans-serif;
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--forest);
}

.brand-mark {
  width: 42px;
  height: 42px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  border-radius: 15px;
  color: var(--cream);
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest), #40916c);
  box-shadow: var(--soft-shadow);
}

.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
}

.nav-links a {
  padding: 10px 15px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  color: var(--forest-dark);
  font-weight: 700;
  transition: background 180ms ease, color 180ms ease;
}

.nav-links a:hover { background: var(--mint); color: var(--forest); }
.menu-toggle { display: none; }

.section-pad { padding: clamp(68px, 8vw, 118px) clamp(18px, 4vw, 56px); }

.hero {
  max-width: 1240px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(360px, 0.9fr);
  gap: clamp(34px, 6vw, 86px);
  align-items: center;
}

.eyebrow {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  color: var(--terracotta);
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
}

h1, h2, h3 {
  font-family: "Nunito", sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.05;
  margin: 0;
}

h1 {
  max-width: 700px;
  font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 8vw, 6.9rem);
  letter-spacing: -0.07em;
  color: var(--forest-dark);
}

h2 {
  font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 4.4rem);
  letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  color: var(--forest-dark);
}

h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--forest-dark); }

.hero-subtitle, .section-heading p, .locator-copy p, .newsletter-card p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 1.08rem;
}

.hero-subtitle { max-width: 620px; margin: 22px 0 30px; font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 2vw, 1.3rem); }

.hero-actions, .locator-form, .newsletter-form { display: flex; gap: 13px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }

.btn {
  border: 0;
  min-height: 52px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 14px 22px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-weight: 900;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: transform 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease, background 180ms ease;
}

.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
.btn-primary { color: var(--cream); background: var(--forest); box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.22); }
.btn-primary:hover { background: var(--forest-dark); }
.btn-secondary { color: var(--forest-dark); background: var(--yellow); box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(244, 162, 97, 0.22); }
.btn-secondary:hover { background: #ffc247; }

.hero-visual { position: relative; min-height: 590px; }
.market-card {
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 12px solid var(--white);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  background: var(--white);
}
.main-photo {
  height: 530px;
  border-radius: 46px;
  transform: rotate(2deg);
}
.main-photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
.floating-card {
  position: absolute;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 16px 18px;
  border-radius: 22px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  border: 1px solid rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.12);
}
.floating-card i { width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 14px; color: var(--forest); background: var(--mint); font-size: 1.25rem; }
.floating-card strong { display: block; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--forest-dark); }
.floating-card span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.92rem; }
.deal-card { top: 70px; left: -28px; }
.rating-card { right: -18px; bottom: 88px; }

.stats-banner {
  width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 36px));
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 30px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 18px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest), #40916c);
  color: var(--cream);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}
.stat-item { padding: 18px; border-radius: 24px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10); }
.stat-item strong { display: block; font-family: "Nunito", sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 0.95; color: var(--yellow); }
.stat-item span { display: block; margin-top: 7px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 1.03rem; }
.stat-item p { margin: 8px 0 0; color: rgba(254, 250, 224, 0.82); font-size: 0.93rem; }

.products-section, .categories { max-width: 1290px; margin: 0 auto; }
.section-heading { margin-bottom: 30px; }
.split-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 24px; }
.section-heading p { margin: 12px 0 0; max-width: 680px; }
.centered { text-align: center; max-width: 780px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
.centered .eyebrow { justify-content: center; }
.centered p { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

.carousel-controls { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex: 0 0 auto; }
.carousel-btn {
  width: 52px;
  height: 52px;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 50%;
  color: var(--forest);
  background: var(--white);
  box-shadow: var(--soft-shadow);
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  transition: transform 180ms ease, background 180ms ease;
}
.carousel-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: var(--mint); }
.carousel-shell { position: relative; }
.product-carousel {
  display: grid;
  grid-auto-flow: column;
  grid-auto-columns: clamp(260px, 28vw, 340px);
  gap: 22px;
  overflow-x: auto;
  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  padding: 10px 4px 28px;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
  scrollbar-color: var(--sage) transparent;
}
.product-card {
  scroll-snap-align: start;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  background: var(--white);
  box-shadow: var(--soft-shadow);
  border: 1px solid rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.08);
}
.product-card img { width: 100%; height: 210px; object-fit: cover; }
.product-info { padding: 21px; }
.pill { display: inline-flex; margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--mint); color: var(--forest); font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 900; }
.product-info p { min-height: 74px; margin: 10px 0 14px; color: var(--muted); }
.product-info strong, .seasonal-card strong { color: var(--terracotta); font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 900; }

.seasonal { background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(254, 250, 224, 0), rgba(216, 243, 220, 0.52)); }
.seasonal-grid {
  max-width: 1180px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
}
.seasonal-card {
  min-height: 240px;
  padding: 24px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  background: var(--white);
  box-shadow: var(--soft-shadow);
  border: 1px solid rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.08);
}
.seasonal-card i { color: var(--orange); font-size: 2.2rem; }
.seasonal-card p { color: var(--muted); }
.seasonal-card.highlight { grid-row: span 2; padding: 0; overflow: hidden; }
.seasonal-card.highlight img { height: 360px; width: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
.seasonal-card.highlight div { padding: 26px; }

.category-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
  gap: 18px;
}
.category-card {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 270px;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  padding: 20px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  color: var(--white);
  background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(31, 76, 57, 0.05), rgba(31, 76, 57, 0.74)), var(--bg);
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  box-shadow: var(--soft-shadow);
  transform: translateZ(0);
  transition: transform 220ms ease, box-shadow 220ms ease;
}
.category-card::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.88), rgba(244, 162, 97, 0.74));
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 220ms ease;
}
.category-card span, .category-card strong { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.category-card span { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); transition: opacity 220ms ease, transform 220ms ease; font-weight: 700; }
.category-card strong { margin-top: 8px; font-family: "Nunito", sans-serif; font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.05; }
.category-card:hover, .category-card:focus-visible { transform: scale(1.035); box-shadow: var(--shadow); outline: none; }
.category-card:hover::before, .category-card:focus-visible::before { opacity: 1; }
.category-card:hover span, .category-card:focus-visible span { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

.locator-card, .newsletter-card {
  max-width: 1120px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 54px);
  border-radius: 42px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
